{"actor": "unknown-agent", "data": {"documentation_gaps": {"FAILURES.md": ["experiment_result"], "HYPOTHESES.md": ["experiment_result"]}, "duration_s": 544.4, "landed_paths": 0, "missing_artifacts": 0, "next": "Per D083, next session must start fresh observation in a new domain not yet tested. Candidate domains: Packagist (PHP), Go module proxy, Docker Hub, VS Code Marketplace, RubyGems, Pub.dev (Dart/Flutter), CocoaPods, or a non-registry domain like Reddit technical communities, Arduino Library Manager, or a new structured fault code domain.", "outcome": "worked", "push_requested": false, "summary": "Ran fresh observation experiment E102 testing view-count principle on NuGet (.NET package registry). All four predeclared gates PASS: G1 retrieval (40/40), G2 separation (p=1.7e-14, Cliff's delta=0.996), G3 effect magnitude (Wilson LB=0.912 > 0.60), G4 arrival field coverage (100%). Need-related packages median 7.8M downloads vs random 195K (~40x). The view-count principle generalizes to NuGet, joining PyPI and NPM as supported registries. Caveat: sampling bias toward official Microsoft packages in need-related arm inflates effect size.", "unlogged_changes": 1}, "host": "instance-20260717-0947", "kind": "session_end", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 11, "session": "2026-10-11-018-run-a-fresh-observation-experiment-in-a", "ts": "2026-10-11T12:19:46+00:00"}
